# Shared UI Boundaries

- Use `src/app/shared/ui/` only for cross-feature reusable UI.
- Keep shared components standalone with explicit typed `input()` and `output()` APIs.
- Do not move feature-specific business logic into shared UI.
- Prefer generic contracts over leaking feature/domain-specific models when possible.
- Prefer small focused components over one large configurable shared component.
- Export shared UI through the intended public API surface.
